  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You rewrite a beast's physical form, applying one of the following permanent-seeming alterations for 1 hour: grant the beast a flight speed of 40 ft and wings; grant the beast +4 AC from chitinous plating; make the beast Large (if it is smaller); or grant the beast a second natural weapon attack per turn. The beast remembers none of this after the spell ends but remains altered in subtle, permanent ways (DM discretion).</p><p><em>At Higher Levels: At 5th level, grant two alterations. At 6th, the duration becomes 24 hours.</em></p>",
